#: js/congress-admin.js:115
msgid ""
"An event app is the companion page your visitors open with their ticket: "
"programme and schedule, speaker or artist info, venue maps, downloads, media "
"and support pages — everything structured in one place. Perfect for a "
"congress with multiple sessions, but just as much for a single event where "
"ticket holders need extra info, a FAQ or contact options. Visitors do not "
"need an account or an extra app: their ticket ID is the key, access opens "
"with the ticket and can expire with it. Assign an event app to a product in "
"the WooCommerce product settings — one app can serve multiple products, so "
"an event series shares one app."
msgstr ""

